{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Being able to cast Counterspell at least once per long rest, having the Extra Attack feature and having received proper training as an Anti-Mage.\n\nYou are a relentless force against magic-wielders, honing your skills to counter and obliterate their arcane powers. You gain the following enhanced benefits:\n\n- Arcane Sight: Your connection to the weave of magic is unparalleled. You gain proficiency in the Arcana skill, and you have advantage on Intelligence (Arcana) checks related to identifying spells and magical effects.\n\n- Disruptive Strikes: When you make a weapon or unarmed attack against a spellcaster and hit, the target must make a Constitution saving throw with disadvantage to maintain concentration on an active spell. Additionally, your attacks against spellcasters are considered magical for the purpose of overcoming resistances and immunities.\n\nAntimagic Mastery: You\u0027ve achieved mastery over nullifying magic. Once per long rest, when you hit with an attack against an Spellcaster, you can attempt to short-circuit the magical essence within a spellcaster. The spellcaster must make a Constitution saving throw with disadvantage (DC equal to 8 + twice your proficiency bonus) or loose the ability to cast spells for 1 minute. Additionally, they receive damage equal to the combined number of spell slots (each spell slot counts as it\u0027s level for calculating the total) they have x your Proficiency Bonus, burning (expending) the spell slots they had. On an failed save, they receive half damage and no other effects.","level":1}],"id":"Custom480fc015-f4ba-4cd8-88ea-69300e92bb4e","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Anti-Magic Champion [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}